## DET-006 — Remote Administrative SMB Logon

Remote network authentication activity associated with the attack sequence was investigated.

```text
Source IP: 10.10.10.101
Account: WIN11-01$
```

The activity provided evidence of communication originating from WIN11-01 during the simulated attack sequence.

### Analyst Observation

The investigation also demonstrated that Event ID 4624 alone is too broad for reliable identification of remote administrative SMB activity because Windows generates successful logon events during normal operations.

This observation resulted in a detection-tuning recommendation for DET-006.

