## F003 — Privileged Group Membership Change

```text
Finding ID: F003
Detection: DET-005
Event ID: 4728
Timestamp: 17:50:17.637
Added Account: CORR001 Test
Actor: tadmin
```

The account `CORR001 Test` was added to a privileged domain group by `tadmin`.

The event occurred after the PowerShell execution and scheduled-task activity.

### Finding

```text
A privileged domain group membership modification was identified at
17:50:17.637.

Added Account:
CORR001 Test

Actor:
tadmin
```

This represented the privilege-modification stage of the simulated attack sequence.

