## Incident Assessment

The correlated activity represented a controlled SOC lab simulation.

The detections identified intentionally generated suspicious behavior.

Therefore:

```text
Detection Result: True Positive
Disposition: Benign Positive — Authorized Security Testing
```

The incident was not classified as a false positive because the detections correctly identified the generated behaviors.

